---
title: Kim Kebabs
servings: 2
prepTime: 2hr
cookTime: 30m
rating: 4
description: Quick and easy for weeknight meals.
source: Kim Blanchette
tags: Chicken
---

For oven preparation, preheat the oven to 450°F. For grill preparation, preheat the grill on medium heat.

Cover the @chicken breasts{2}(cut into large cubes) in @Italian dressing{} for up to ~{2%hours}.

Skewer the chicken, alternating with @mushrooms{8%oz}(optional), @red bell pepper{2}(optional, cut into large chunks),
@red onion{1}(optional, quartered), @zucchini{1}(optional, sliced thick), or other vegetables.

Drizzle everything with @balsamic vinegar{}(dark or aged) and @white balsamic vinegar{}.

Cook ~{20-30%min} in the oven or grill, flipping halfway.
Ensure the chicken is thoroughly cooked to 165°F.
